WEBVTT

00:00:02.670 --> 00:00:04.010
Hey, Miss Number Fifty.

00:00:04.010 --> 00:00:07.150
Don’t you feel like the
Irie Naoki of Class F?

00:00:08.160 --> 00:00:10.030
Not quite.

00:00:10.030 --> 00:00:12.980
Hey, you dropped something, Kotoko.

00:00:14.240 --> 00:00:15.580
I forgot about this.

00:00:15.580 --> 00:00:18.290
What’s that?

00:00:18.290 --> 00:00:21.450
It’s a good luck charm which helped me get into the top fifty.

00:00:21.450 --> 00:00:23.000
Don’t you want to share it with us?

00:00:25.580 --> 00:00:27.140
What the hell is this?!

00:00:27.140 --> 00:00:28.450
Kin-san, hang in there, man!

00:00:28.450 --> 00:00:30.880
Oh, no. The shock was too much!
Water, water!

00:00:30.880 --> 00:00:33.510
Hey, Kotoko! What is this about?!

00:00:33.510 --> 00:00:36.000
Umm... well...

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:39.070
Why are you and Irie
sleeping together so happily?

00:00:39.070 --> 00:00:41.140
Forgive me!

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:44.140
Your parents are close friends?

00:00:44.140 --> 00:00:48.700
So, you had Irie tutor you
for the tests this time?

00:00:48.700 --> 00:00:49.780
Yeah.

00:00:49.780 --> 00:00:54.930
So that explains you being in the top fifty. He really is a genius.

00:00:54.930 --> 00:00:56.160
That’s a really harsh way to put it.

00:00:56.750 --> 00:00:59.180
But, don’t they look really close in these photos?

00:00:59.180 --> 00:01:04.190
With you living under the same roof, has Irie’s heart, or maybe his preferences changed too?

00:01:04.190 --> 00:01:06.170
Don’t be stupid!

00:01:06.170 --> 00:01:07.790
That’s right!

00:01:07.790 --> 00:01:11.560
Even at home, he totally ignores me.

00:01:11.560 --> 00:01:13.030
He hates me.

00:01:13.030 --> 00:01:14.730
Kotoko...

00:01:14.730 --> 00:01:16.260
Poor thing.

00:01:16.260 --> 00:01:17.660
That’s horrible.

00:01:17.660 --> 00:01:21.720
But, I don’t care about that cold-hearted guy. I’m fine.

00:01:22.500 --> 00:01:23.850
Cold-hearted?

00:01:24.180 --> 00:01:25.300
Good luck.

00:01:25.300 --> 00:01:27.180
You did it too.

00:01:30.230 --> 00:01:32.210
Kotoko?

00:01:32.210 --> 00:01:35.570
Either way, I’m only living
with him temporarily.

00:01:36.100 --> 00:01:38.680
Please keep this a secret, okay?

00:01:38.680 --> 00:01:39.670
Please.

00:01:39.670 --> 00:01:40.840
Okay.

00:01:40.840 --> 00:01:42.590
Of course we will.

00:01:48.710 --> 00:01:50.210
Aihara!

00:01:50.210 --> 00:01:51.920
Come with me!

00:01:58.720 --> 00:02:00.730
What the hell is this?!

00:02:00.730 --> 00:02:02.440
That’s what I’d like to know.

00:02:02.440 --> 00:02:05.980
Those guys! I fervently told them
to keep this secret too!

00:02:07.730 --> 00:02:09.490
I’ve had it up to here!

00:02:09.490 --> 00:02:10.530
Irie-kun.

00:02:10.530 --> 00:02:14.190
You may be okay with it,
but it’s a problem for me!

00:02:14.190 --> 00:02:17.930
Don’t mess with my life any more!

00:02:22.190 --> 00:02:24.580
What’s with me?

00:02:24.580 --> 00:02:29.470
No matter how much he bullies me...
I hate him after all.

00:02:29.470 --> 00:02:31.590
I’m already fine with it.

00:02:31.590 --> 00:02:33.540
I should be fine with it.

00:02:34.370 --> 00:02:39.050
I was able to endure it when he refused my love letter.

00:02:39.050 --> 00:02:41.550
But then, why do I...?

00:02:43.110 --> 00:02:45.370
I guess...

00:02:45.370 --> 00:02:49.650
...I really do love Irie-kun.

00:04:42.170 --> 00:04:45.600
The first love letter that I ever wrote...

00:04:45.600 --> 00:04:47.800
...wasn’t even read.

00:04:48.720 --> 00:04:53.600
I can’t believe I’m still in love with that cold-hearted bully.

00:04:53.600 --> 00:04:55.750
Am I a masochist?

00:04:56.580 --> 00:04:59.070
Even though he’s so near...

00:04:59.070 --> 00:05:01.090
It’s so depressing...

00:05:12.040 --> 00:05:14.910
Hey, the bath is free. You can go in.

00:05:32.600 --> 00:05:34.360
Nice to meet you, Irie-kun.

00:05:34.360 --> 00:05:38.110
I’m Aihara Kotoko from Class-F.

00:05:38.110 --> 00:05:40.640
You don’t know who I am, right?

00:05:40.640 --> 00:05:43.150
But, I know who you are.

00:05:43.150 --> 00:05:45.620
For two years, I admired you for your
intelligence and coolness...

00:05:45.620 --> 00:05:47.650
...after you gave your
entrance ceremony speech.

00:05:47.650 --> 00:05:49.990
I have no hope of being in the same
class as you...

00:05:49.990 --> 00:05:54.110
...so I write my feelings in this letter with all my heart.

00:05:54.110 --> 00:05:57.160
Irie-kun, I love you.

00:06:00.040 --> 00:06:04.550
Towel: in. Headband: in. Sports clothes: in.

00:06:05.360 --> 00:06:07.010
Also, water.

00:06:08.790 --> 00:06:12.090
Wallet and train pass are in my pocket.

00:06:12.090 --> 00:06:13.810
Great, all prepared.

00:06:15.030 --> 00:06:16.700
But...

00:06:16.700 --> 00:06:19.760
...I’m really not in the mood for this.

00:06:22.300 --> 00:06:24.880
I just can’t wait for your sports festival!

00:06:24.880 --> 00:06:26.730
Do your best, both of you!

00:06:26.730 --> 00:06:28.780
Kotoko-chan, what are you participating in?

00:06:28.780 --> 00:06:32.820
I’m in the boys-girls mixed relay and the borrowing race.

00:06:32.820 --> 00:06:34.410
And you, Naoki?

00:06:34.410 --> 00:06:37.700
The hundred meter and the mixed relay.

00:06:37.700 --> 00:06:42.210
Oh! Then, you two will be running on the same track?

00:06:42.210 --> 00:06:44.080
That’s wonderful!

00:06:44.080 --> 00:06:47.280
I’m capture every minute on video from start to end!

00:06:48.710 --> 00:06:50.710
You can count on me to get shots of both of you together.

00:06:50.710 --> 00:06:52.900
Give me a break.

00:06:52.900 --> 00:06:54.720
Thanks for the food.

00:06:55.970 --> 00:07:00.740
He really does hate me, doesn’t he?

00:07:01.730 --> 00:07:03.630
Class-B!

00:07:19.420 --> 00:07:23.000
Class-F, go Class-F!

00:07:23.000 --> 00:07:26.560
<i>Facing the storm head on.</i>

00:07:26.560 --> 00:07:29.510
<i>You hoist the flag valiantly.</i>

00:07:29.510 --> 00:07:33.020
The Class-F boys are pinning all their hopes on this day, aren’t they?

00:07:33.650 --> 00:07:35.390
And compared to them...

00:07:35.390 --> 00:07:38.350
Class-A not only doesn’t care...

00:07:38.350 --> 00:07:39.890
...they’re actually studying.

00:07:40.430 --> 00:07:43.820
But, other than F and E, they’re about the same as the other classes.

00:07:43.820 --> 00:07:47.440
But look! Over there, there’s one sign that really stands out.

00:07:47.440 --> 00:07:49.360
Oh, you’re right.

00:07:50.720 --> 00:07:51.900
Hey, wait.

00:07:53.580 --> 00:07:57.910
Kotoko-chan! Make sure you
cheer Onii-chan on!

00:07:57.910 --> 00:07:59.620
Uh... Oba-sama?

00:07:59.620 --> 00:08:01.660
That really stands out.

00:08:01.660 --> 00:08:03.200
Doesn’t that one stand out the most?

00:08:03.200 --> 00:08:05.920
Look! The boys’ hundred meter is starting!

00:08:09.680 --> 00:08:13.960
Listen here, Irie.
I’ll never lose to the likes of <i>you</i>.

00:08:13.960 --> 00:08:16.180
I’ll show you my speed.

00:08:16.670 --> 00:08:18.180
On your marks!

00:08:19.070 --> 00:08:20.180
Irie-kun.

00:08:22.930 --> 00:08:24.770
Set!

00:08:26.750 --> 00:08:28.150
Irie-kun!

00:08:30.440 --> 00:08:31.740
Do your best!

00:08:33.360 --> 00:08:36.510
It looks like Kin-chan is much
faster after all.

00:08:36.510 --> 00:08:38.050
But, Irie got second!

00:08:38.050 --> 00:08:39.990
Oh, you’re covering for him.

00:08:39.990 --> 00:08:41.790
No, I’m not...

00:08:42.480 --> 00:08:47.090
But, it’s just that... The sight of Irie-kun losing is unbelievable.

00:08:48.210 --> 00:08:51.710
The final event for the morning session is program 12:

00:08:51.710 --> 00:08:55.090
The Year-3 Girls borrowing race.

00:08:56.480 --> 00:08:58.130
Onii-chan!

00:08:58.130 --> 00:09:00.460
Come on, Onii-chan, hurry!

00:09:00.460 --> 00:09:02.230
Let’s cheer for Kotoko-chan together!

00:09:02.230 --> 00:09:03.390
But, why?

00:09:03.390 --> 00:09:05.390
On your marks.

00:09:07.150 --> 00:09:10.400
Please, let me get something easy...

00:09:10.850 --> 00:09:12.240
Set!

00:09:16.990 --> 00:09:18.950
Let’s see...

00:09:21.240 --> 00:09:22.780
No way!

00:09:22.780 --> 00:09:23.910
What’s this?

00:09:23.910 --> 00:09:27.380
But, the person I love is...

00:09:31.010 --> 00:09:34.720
If it’s the person I love,
then it has to be...

00:09:37.560 --> 00:09:39.620
Um...

00:09:42.570 --> 00:09:44.850
I can do this!

00:09:44.850 --> 00:09:45.810
Irie–

00:09:48.040 --> 00:09:49.560
He’s glaring at me...

00:09:53.070 --> 00:09:56.200
Iri-chan Oji-san, please run with me!

00:09:59.840 --> 00:10:00.910
Me?

00:10:00.910 --> 00:10:03.770
Oh, my, Papa!
This is a heavy responsibility!

00:10:03.770 --> 00:10:05.910
Go and good luck!

00:10:05.910 --> 00:10:08.130
All right! Let’s go, Kotoko-chan!

00:10:08.130 --> 00:10:08.920
Okay.

00:10:10.030 --> 00:10:11.720
This isn’t right!

00:10:11.720 --> 00:10:14.340
Why did I let it turn out like this?

00:10:14.340 --> 00:10:18.120
Kotoko-chan, Papa, go!

00:10:20.760 --> 00:10:22.660
I’m sorry, Kotoko-chan.

00:10:22.660 --> 00:10:25.350
It’s my fault you got last place.

00:10:25.350 --> 00:10:28.850
It’s okay, it’s just a game after all.

00:10:28.850 --> 00:10:31.810
Oh, by the way, what’s the thing you were supposed to borrow anyway?

00:10:32.820 --> 00:10:39.360
Would you believe it? It was, “The Person You Love.”

00:10:41.410 --> 00:10:42.950
“The Person You Love”?

00:10:43.670 --> 00:10:45.950
It’s because you were glaring at me.

00:10:45.950 --> 00:10:48.060
The afternoon program has begun.

00:10:48.060 --> 00:10:50.750
Students, please return to your respective seats.

00:10:50.750 --> 00:10:54.830
Say, for the final relay, you’re the anchor too, right?

00:10:54.830 --> 00:10:57.390
You’ll be racing Kin-chan again.

00:10:58.220 --> 00:11:02.290
I was actually a little relieved when you lost earlier.

00:11:02.290 --> 00:11:05.410
It was like, even Irie-kun can lose.

00:11:05.410 --> 00:11:07.220
Like, you’re the same as us, I thought.

00:11:07.220 --> 00:11:08.730
Don’t bring me down to your level.

00:11:12.460 --> 00:11:15.730
There’s no way I would use my full strength for something like that.

00:11:15.730 --> 00:11:19.810
Then, you went easy on the other runners?

00:11:20.490 --> 00:11:23.080
Enough with your overconfidence!

00:11:23.080 --> 00:11:26.770
That’s just a sore loser’s excuse!

00:11:28.910 --> 00:11:31.080
Who did you call a sore loser?

00:11:31.710 --> 00:11:32.880
That’s right.

00:11:32.880 --> 00:11:37.630
Prove me wrong then by showing me your true abilities in the final relay!

00:11:38.980 --> 00:11:41.600
Is it really okay to say something like that?

00:11:42.600 --> 00:11:46.220
Class-F will lose their flawless victory.

00:11:55.570 --> 00:11:58.940
You really did it now!

00:12:04.940 --> 00:12:09.450
The last program is the Year 3 students boys-girls mixed relay.

00:12:09.450 --> 00:12:12.440
Participating runners, please gather at the front gate.

00:12:12.440 --> 00:12:13.660
Satomi!

00:12:13.660 --> 00:12:16.960
You’re the starter,
so run with all your might!

00:12:17.540 --> 00:12:19.000
What’s this, all of a sudden?

00:12:19.000 --> 00:12:20.930
I got it.

00:12:20.930 --> 00:12:22.770
On your marks.

00:12:24.320 --> 00:12:25.590
Set!

00:12:25.590 --> 00:12:27.720
What’s gotten into that Kotoko?

00:12:28.930 --> 00:12:30.560
Go!

00:12:33.560 --> 00:12:35.560
Hooray! Hooray! Everyone!

00:12:42.400 --> 00:12:43.350
All right!

00:12:43.350 --> 00:12:46.740
Class-F is in the lead! They’re strong!

00:12:46.740 --> 00:12:48.740
Easy win for Class-F.

00:12:48.740 --> 00:12:51.480
Kotoko, I’m counting on you!

00:12:51.480 --> 00:12:51.750
There!

00:12:51.750 --> 00:12:52.750
Got it!
There!

00:12:52.750 --> 00:12:55.550
Class-F is now on their third runner.

00:12:55.550 --> 00:12:57.170
The gap between second place is huge.

00:12:57.170 --> 00:13:00.510
Second is Class-E, followed by Class-A.

00:13:00.510 --> 00:13:02.840
Class-A is in third place?

00:13:02.840 --> 00:13:08.760
In that case, I’m sorry, but Class-F will win before I even get to see Irie-kun’s abilities!

00:13:13.120 --> 00:13:13.890
Irie-kun...

00:13:13.890 --> 00:13:16.650
Ah, here comes Kotoko.

00:13:16.650 --> 00:13:20.400
Sorry, Mr. Class-A,
but I’m going ahead first.

00:13:21.300 --> 00:13:24.400
Irie-kun is looking at me.

00:13:24.400 --> 00:13:27.160
He’s gently holding his hand out to me.

00:13:27.160 --> 00:13:29.660
This is the first time I’ve experienced this!

00:13:29.660 --> 00:13:31.690
Over here, Kotoko.

00:13:31.690 --> 00:13:32.450
What the?

00:13:33.050 --> 00:13:36.600
Irie-kun!

00:13:39.020 --> 00:13:40.280
Kotoko.

00:13:40.280 --> 00:13:41.290
Go away!

00:13:43.720 --> 00:13:46.680
What are you doing, Kotoko?

00:13:46.680 --> 00:13:49.590
Irie-kun!

00:13:49.590 --> 00:13:50.440
Kotoko?

00:13:52.170 --> 00:13:54.380
Kin-chan? Why am I...?

00:13:54.380 --> 00:13:55.740
Where’s Irie-kun?

00:13:55.740 --> 00:13:57.410
Why are you all dazed out?

00:13:57.410 --> 00:13:59.260
Hurry and pass me the baton.

00:13:59.260 --> 00:14:01.020
Baton?

00:14:02.880 --> 00:14:03.690
Class-F’s third runner has just collided with their anchor.
You idiot.

00:14:03.690 --> 00:14:05.900
Class-E just overtook you guys.

00:14:05.900 --> 00:14:09.830
Class-E is now in the lead after handing their anchor the baton.

00:14:09.830 --> 00:14:12.370
It’s okay, Kotoko! Just leave it to me!

00:14:19.680 --> 00:14:21.670
Oh, shoot!

00:14:23.800 --> 00:14:26.010
How could I make such a huge mistake?

00:14:26.010 --> 00:14:28.930
I lost sight of everything but Irie-kun...

00:14:30.480 --> 00:14:31.930
That’s Class-F for you!

00:14:31.930 --> 00:14:34.240
They’re back in the lead
despite the late hand-off.

00:14:34.240 --> 00:14:39.790
Oh, my! Unbelievable! Even Class-A has overtaken Class-E!

00:14:39.790 --> 00:14:42.280
Class-A is steadily increasing the pace.

00:14:42.280 --> 00:14:44.150
Class-A’s anchor is the one and only, Irie-kun!

00:14:47.400 --> 00:14:49.860
Irie-kun. Kin-chan.

00:14:52.900 --> 00:14:57.260
Class-F and A are battling for the lead.
There’s only half a lap left!

00:14:59.580 --> 00:15:03.650
Irie-kun is fast! The lead is rapidly closing!

00:15:03.650 --> 00:15:06.130
Oh! Irie-kun has overtaken!

00:15:06.130 --> 00:15:07.850
Class-A’s Irie-kun is now in the lead!

00:15:07.850 --> 00:15:09.120
I don’t believe it!

00:15:09.120 --> 00:15:12.400
Only 50 more meters to the finish!

00:15:15.450 --> 00:15:16.850
Irie-kun.

00:15:19.110 --> 00:15:20.980
Hey, don’t push!

00:15:23.900 --> 00:15:25.070
Class-A crosses!

00:15:29.090 --> 00:15:31.160
Kotoko-chan! Onii-chan!

00:15:31.160 --> 00:15:36.160
Oh, no! Irie-kun tripped and fell on top of a girl near the finish line!

00:15:37.810 --> 00:15:41.550
You idiot! Why are you taking a nap in a place like this?!

00:15:45.630 --> 00:15:47.880
Hey, Aihara.

00:15:51.600 --> 00:15:54.100
Sheesh, do I have to keep
taking care of you?

00:15:57.430 --> 00:15:58.960
I’m sorry.

00:15:58.960 --> 00:16:00.600
Kotoko, are you all right?!

00:16:00.600 --> 00:16:02.080
Irie, you idiot!

00:16:02.080 --> 00:16:05.600
How could you fall on top of Kotoko?!

00:16:05.600 --> 00:16:06.610
Move it.

00:16:08.320 --> 00:16:12.610
What’s with you?! Where do you think
you’re taking my Kotoko?!

00:16:12.610 --> 00:16:14.820
The nurse’s office, obviously.

00:16:14.820 --> 00:16:17.040
I’ll do that!

00:16:17.040 --> 00:16:18.890
You and your arrogance!

00:16:18.890 --> 00:16:22.620
If only that didn’t happen during the relay...

00:16:23.140 --> 00:16:25.630
A sore loser’s excuse?

00:16:33.620 --> 00:16:36.540
God damn it!

00:16:37.390 --> 00:16:43.380
Would you believe it? Irie-kun of Class-A is carrying
Aihara-san of Class-F to the nurse’s office.

00:16:43.380 --> 00:16:45.900
Well done, Onii-chan!

00:16:47.760 --> 00:16:50.700
Hey, is this all right?

00:16:50.700 --> 00:16:52.310
I’ve gotten used to it.

00:16:54.500 --> 00:16:58.610
Hey, how long are you going watch that video before you’re satisfied?

00:16:58.610 --> 00:17:02.090
But, you two look so wonderful and suited for each other.

00:17:02.090 --> 00:17:04.380
You two should just get married already.

00:17:05.040 --> 00:17:08.380
Onii-chan, actually, your type of girl is someone like Kotoko-chan, right?

00:17:09.640 --> 00:17:10.630
Really?

00:17:10.630 --> 00:17:12.350
Of course not.

00:17:12.350 --> 00:17:14.430
You’re not my type either!

00:17:14.430 --> 00:17:17.050
Oh, is that so?

00:17:17.050 --> 00:17:19.170
I was so certain too.

00:17:19.170 --> 00:17:21.840
Even though you sent me such a passionate message.

00:17:21.840 --> 00:17:24.230
“Nice to meet you, Irie-kun.”

00:17:24.230 --> 00:17:26.850
“I’m Aihara Kotoko from Class-F.”

00:17:27.940 --> 00:17:30.940
What you just said... Could it be...?

00:17:30.940 --> 00:17:33.940
“For two years, I admired you for your intelligence and coolness

00:17:33.940 --> 00:17:36.990
after you gave your entrance
ceremony speech.”

00:17:36.990 --> 00:17:39.700
“I have no hope of being in the same class as you...”

00:17:39.700 --> 00:17:41.450
What’s this about?

00:17:41.450 --> 00:17:44.700
So, Onii-chan, does that mean...?

00:17:44.700 --> 00:17:46.960
“Irie-kun, I love you.”

00:18:00.380 --> 00:18:03.060
You read it without my permission?
That’s terrible!

00:18:03.060 --> 00:18:05.130
You wrote it to me, didn’t you?!

00:18:05.130 --> 00:18:06.900
You didn’t have to memorize it!

00:18:06.900 --> 00:18:09.600
I can’t help it if I memorize everything after reading it once!

00:18:09.600 --> 00:18:11.150
Say...

00:18:11.150 --> 00:18:17.850
Kotoko-chan, did you perhaps, write a love letter to Onii-chan?

00:18:19.630 --> 00:18:22.120
Is that true, Kotoko?
Without telling me?!

00:18:22.120 --> 00:18:25.140
Then, what I said earlier isn’t just wishful thinking!

00:18:25.140 --> 00:18:27.000
Hold it right there!

00:18:32.460 --> 00:18:34.500
Kin-chan, why are you here?

00:18:34.500 --> 00:18:39.240
To protect you from this bastard, obviously.

00:18:39.240 --> 00:18:41.550
Hello, everyone in the Irie family.

00:18:41.550 --> 00:18:43.310
This is the first time we’ve met.

00:18:43.310 --> 00:18:46.830
I’m Kotoko’s classmate, Ikezawa Kinnosuke.

00:18:46.830 --> 00:18:49.270
Better known as Kin-chan.

00:18:49.270 --> 00:18:53.360
I’m completely devoted to Kotoko.

00:18:53.360 --> 00:18:56.100
My passion is number one in Japan!

00:18:56.100 --> 00:18:57.680
No, number one in the world!

00:18:57.680 --> 00:18:59.850
I’m confident I won’t be beaten by anyone.

00:18:59.850 --> 00:19:01.930
Wait, Kin-chan. What are...?

00:19:01.930 --> 00:19:05.450
Oh, my. You’re really popular with the boys, Kotoko. This is a problem.

00:19:05.450 --> 00:19:07.370
No, I’m not that...

00:19:07.370 --> 00:19:10.380
Compared to that, Mr. Genius here...

00:19:10.380 --> 00:19:13.880
...not only doesn’t love Kotoko, he honestly hates her!

00:19:13.880 --> 00:19:16.250
Marriage doesn’t even enter
the picture here.

00:19:16.250 --> 00:19:20.090
Well, that’s something he himself would know best.

00:19:20.090 --> 00:19:22.220
I don’t know about that.

00:19:26.930 --> 00:19:29.760
People’s feelings can change.

00:19:29.760 --> 00:19:33.940
Like, you may hate someone today, but you might come to love that person tomorrow.

00:19:33.940 --> 00:19:35.950
What did you say?!

00:19:35.950 --> 00:19:36.940
What does that mean?!

00:19:37.620 --> 00:19:39.320
Please make yourself comfortable.

00:19:39.320 --> 00:19:42.320
Hey! I’m not done talking!

00:19:47.970 --> 00:19:50.830
We just heard...

00:19:51.410 --> 00:19:53.850
“Might love”...?

00:19:53.850 --> 00:19:56.590
Irie-kun said that?

00:19:59.360 --> 00:20:01.110
I don’t believe it...

00:20:11.650 --> 00:20:12.730
It’s Aihara.

00:20:12.730 --> 00:20:15.190
Maybe “Mrs. Irie”
would be more appropriate...

00:20:15.190 --> 00:20:17.610
What an unexpected pair.

00:20:17.610 --> 00:20:21.550
Did I do something bad again?

00:20:21.550 --> 00:20:22.270
Hey.

00:20:22.270 --> 00:20:23.110
Yeah?

00:20:25.250 --> 00:20:26.880
He’s angry?

00:20:26.880 --> 00:20:28.440
Come.

00:20:29.700 --> 00:20:31.540
Huh? What could this be about?

00:20:35.870 --> 00:20:38.670
What is it this time?

00:20:38.670 --> 00:20:40.730
That. Take a look.

00:20:51.370 --> 00:20:53.400
Who would draw...?

00:20:53.400 --> 00:20:55.260
That’s what I’d like to know.

00:20:55.260 --> 00:20:57.190
Drawing this nonsense again.

00:21:00.180 --> 00:21:03.200
It’s not exactly nonsense though.

00:21:03.200 --> 00:21:04.700
What did you say?

00:21:04.700 --> 00:21:08.910
Because, yesterday, you said that there was a possibility that you could come to love me.

00:21:08.910 --> 00:21:11.660
I said it because of the situation!

00:21:12.650 --> 00:21:14.510
It’s sure getting hot in here.

00:21:14.510 --> 00:21:16.670
They’re already having a lovers quarrel.

00:21:16.670 --> 00:21:20.740
Besides, nothing good has happened to me ever since you came!

00:21:20.740 --> 00:21:22.730
It’s more than just a bother now!

00:21:22.730 --> 00:21:24.670
Hey, are you listening?

00:21:24.670 --> 00:21:26.680
Honestly, this isn’t funny!

00:21:27.340 --> 00:21:30.280
Things are still the same between us now.

00:21:30.280 --> 00:21:35.320
But, just like Irie-kun said, we don’t know what tomorrow holds.

00:23:08.230 --> 00:23:11.860
July 28th: Kotoko is having extra lessons again today.

00:23:11.860 --> 00:23:13.510
What are you writing, Yuuki-kun?

00:23:13.510 --> 00:23:16.180
Don’t look! It’s my open summer research.

00:23:16.180 --> 00:23:18.290
But, it’s still only July!

00:23:18.290 --> 00:23:21.370
Don’t bring me down to your stupid level.

00:23:21.370 --> 00:23:22.460
What a mouth!

00:23:22.460 --> 00:23:24.970
And I was thinking of bringing you to the pool too.

00:23:24.970 --> 00:23:28.960
There’s no way I’d ever go with you!

00:23:28.960 --> 00:23:31.180
Next time on Itazura na Kiss:

00:23:31.180 --> 00:23:32.950
Exciting Summer Vacation.

00:23:32.950 --> 00:23:35.190
I’m definitely gonna be happy.
